    <meta name="description" content="Learn how RO Service Support uses cookies to improve your browsing experience." />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://roservicesupport.co.in/cookie-policy" />
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; background: #f4f7fb; color: #222; line-height: 1.6; }
        header { background: #0A2B4E; padding: 14px 0; }
        .header-inner { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 0 20px; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .logo { font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; }
        .logo span { color: #f97316; }
        .back-link { color: #fff; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 600; }
        .back-link:hover { color: #f97316; }
        .container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px 20px 60px; }
        .page-title { font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0A2B4E; margin-bottom: 8px; text-align: justify; line-height: 1.2; }
        .page-subtitle { font-size: 0.85rem; color: #888; margin-bottom: 32px; text-align: justify; }
        .content-box { background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 32px 24px; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.04); }
        .content-box h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0A2B4E; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: justify; line-height: 1.3; }
        .content-box h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
        .content-box p { font-size: 0.92rem; color: #555; line-height: 1.75; text-align: justify; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .content-box ul { margin: 12px 0 16px 20px; font-size: 0.92rem; color: #555; line-height: 1.75; text-align: justify; }
        .content-box li { margin-bottom: 6px; }
        footer { background: #0A2B4E; color: #94a3b8; padding: 24px; text-align: center; font-size: 0.85rem; }
        footer a { color: #f97316; text-decoration: none; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <div class="header-inner">
            <a href="/" class="logo">RO <span>Service Support</span></a>
            <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to Home</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
        <h1 class="page-title">Cookie Policy</h1>
        <p class="page-subtitle">Last updated: January 2025</p>

        <div class="content-box">
            <h2>1. What Are Cookies</h2>
            <p>
                Cookies are small text files that are stored on your device (computer, smartphone, or tablet) when you visit a website. They help the website remember your preferences and improve your overall browsing experience.
            </p>

            <h2>2. How We Use Cookies</h2>
            <p>RO Service Support uses cookies for the following purposes:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>To remember your form data during your session</li>
                <li>To understand how visitors use our website</li>
                <li>To improve website performance and user experience</li>
                <li>To display relevant advertisements through Google Ads</li>
                <li>To measure the effectiveness of our marketing campaigns</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>3. Types of Cookies We Use</h2>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Essential Cookies:</strong> Required for basic website functions.</li>
                <li><strong>Analytical Cookies:</strong> Help us understand how visitors interact with our site.</li>
                <li><strong>Marketing Cookies:</strong> Used to show relevant ads and track campaign performance.</li>
                <li><strong>Functional Cookies:</strong> Remember your preferences for a better experience.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>4. Third-Party Cookies</h2>
            <p>
                We may use third-party services such as Google Analytics and Google Ads. These services may place their own cookies on your device to collect anonymous usage data. Please refer to their respective privacy policies for more information.
            </p>

            <h2>5. Managing Cookies</h2>
            <p>
                You can control and manage cookies through your browser settings. Most browsers allow you to block or delete cookies. However, please note that disabling cookies may affect the functionality of our website and your overall experience.
            </p>

            <h2>6. Consent</h2>
            <p>
                By continuing to use our website, you consent to the use of cookies as described in this Cookie Policy. If you do not agree, please disable cookies in your browser settings or discontinue using our website.
            </p>

            <h2>7. Changes to This Policy</h2>
            <p>
                We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with a revised "Last updated" date. We recommend checking this page periodically.
            </p>

            <h2>8. Contact Us</h2>
            <p>
                If you have any questions about our Cookie Policy, please contact us:
            </p>
            <p>
                Email: <strong>{EMAIL}</strong><br />
                Phone: <strong>+91 90083 15606</strong>
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2025 RO Service Support. All rights reserved.</p>
